```
$ gen-circleci-orb update --help
Re-sync an existing repo's orb-managed CI wiring to the current flow.

Reads the committed gen-circleci-orb.toml (never overwrites it) and
rewrites only the gen-circleci-orb-managed blocks in .circleci/config.yml,
preserving the consumer's own jobs and customizations. Run with --check in
CI to fail when the wiring is out of date relative to the pinned orb
version.

Usage: gen-circleci-orb update [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <CONFIG>
          Path to gen-circleci-orb.toml
          
          [default: gen-circleci-orb.toml]

      --ci-dir <CI_DIR>
          Path to the .circleci/ directory
          
          [default: .circleci]

      --check
          Verify mode: write nothing and exit non-zero when the CI wiring
          is out of date.
          
          Prints a diff and upgrade guidance. For use in CI.

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

```
